  _description: '**Effect:** The character enters an evasive stance, gaining a temporary
    40% Dodge bonus until their next turn. If an enemy attack misses because of this
    bonus, the character regenerates a +35 Energy points .



    **Explanation:**
    The character focuses on avoiding damage and creating opportunities to act again.
    Successful evasion restores Energy, rewarding players who anticipate enemy attacks
    and maintain their momentum.

